{
  "info": {
    "name": "KVBMS Master API (for Yatroo)",
    "description": "The single consumer-facing API for the City Bus vertical: /public-api/v1/ on mobile-api.citybus.com.np. Covers route search, fares, stop autocomplete, ticket issuance (all 3 paths), validation, cancellation, and ticket history.\n\nAUTH NOTE: POST /partner/federated-login is now built on our side (see the '0. Federated Login' folder below), against the wire format we proposed: X-Signature/X-Timestamp/X-Nonce headers, HMAC-SHA256 over `{timestamp}\\n{nonce}\\n{compact_json_body}`. This is NOT yet verified against a real signed request from your backend -- please confirm or correct the canonical-string format, exchange the actual HMAC_SECRET with us via a secure channel (never paste it into this file), and let us know if a signed example/test vector from your side would help. Once you have a real secret, set it as the `yatroo_hmac_secret` collection variable and the pre-request script signs every call automatically -- nothing to hand-compute.\n\nEvery other endpoint here has already been built and live-tested against production.\n\nTEST DATA: route_id/from_stop/to_stop below point at a real, live, clearly-labeled test route (route_code TEST-01, stops named '(Test)') seeded specifically for this collection -- not a real production route. Safe to search/read/issue test tickets against; every no-auth request (Routes, Stops, Fares) will return real data immediately, no setup needed on your end. trip_id is intentionally left blank -- generating a QR for a trip requires a conductor token, which isn't available until a real trip exists in this test environment.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "mobile_api_url", "value": "https://mobile-api.citybus.com.np" },
    { "key": "passenger_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "conductor_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "route_id", "value": "ffc53ed7-07fc-406e-998f-c594c680f3ba" },
    { "key": "trip_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "ticket_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "from_stop", "value": "TEST-STOP-A" },
    { "key": "to_stop", "value": "TEST-STOP-B" },
    { "key": "yatroo_hmac_secret", "value": "", "description": "Fill this in once the real secret is exchanged with us via a secure channel -- do not paste a real secret into this file if you save/version it." },
    { "key": "citybus_user_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Federated Login",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Federated Login (your backend calls this, never the app directly)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\":\"rider@example.com\",\"external_user_id\":\"yatroo-test-user-1\",\"name\":\"Test Rider\"}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/partner/federated-login", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["partner", "federated-login"] },
            "description": "The body here is a fixed, literal string -- compact JSON, keys already alphabetically sorted (email, external_user_id, name) -- because the pre-request script signs pm.request.body.raw exactly as written. If you edit it, keep it compact with sorted keys, or the signature won't match what's sent. Swap in real values matching whatever external_user_id/email/name your backend would actually send."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const secret = pm.collectionVariables.get('yatroo_hmac_secret');",
                  "if (!secret) { throw new Error('Set the yatroo_hmac_secret collection variable first -- see its description.'); }",
                  "const rawBody = pm.request.body.raw; // must already be compact + sorted-keys, see this request's description",
                  "const timestamp = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000).toString();",
                  "const nonce = pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}');",
                  "const canonical = timestamp + \"\\n\" + nonce + \"\\n\" + rawBody;",
                  "const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(canonical, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
                  "",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Timestamp', value: timestamp });",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Nonce', value: nonce });",
                  "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Signature', value: signature });"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('passenger_token', body.access_token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('citybus_user_id', body.citybus_user_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Routes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Routes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/routes/?status=APPROVED", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["routes", ""], "query": [{ "key": "status", "value": "APPROVED" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Nearby Routes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/routes/?lat=27.7172&lon=85.3240&radius_km=2",
              "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["routes", ""],
              "query": [{ "key": "lat", "value": "27.7172" }, { "key": "lon", "value": "85.3240" }, { "key": "radius_km", "value": "2" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Routes by Stop Pair",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/routes/?from_stop={{from_stop}}&to_stop={{to_stop}}",
              "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["routes", ""],
              "query": [{ "key": "from_stop", "value": "{{from_stop}}" }, { "key": "to_stop", "value": "{{to_stop}}" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Route Detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/routes/{{route_id}}/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["routes", "{{route_id}}", ""] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Route Stops",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/routes/{{route_id}}/stops/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["routes", "{{route_id}}", "stops", ""] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Route Timetable",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/routes/{{route_id}}/timetable/?day_type=WEEKDAY",
              "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["routes", "{{route_id}}", "timetable", ""],
              "query": [{ "key": "day_type", "value": "WEEKDAY" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Stops",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Stop Autocomplete",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/stops/autocomplete/?q=Kal&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["stops", "autocomplete", ""],
              "query": [{ "key": "q", "value": "Kal" }, { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Fares",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Fares",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/fares/?route_id={{route_id}}&from_stop={{from_stop}}&to_stop={{to_stop}}",
              "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["fares", ""],
              "query": [
                { "key": "route_id", "value": "{{route_id}}" },
                { "key": "from_stop", "value": "{{from_stop}}" },
                { "key": "to_stop", "value": "{{to_stop}}" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Tickets",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Trip QR (Conductor)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{conductor_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/trips/{{trip_id}}/qr/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["trips", "{{trip_id}}", "qr", ""] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Issue Ticket - Conductor Direct",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{conductor_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"from_stop_id\": \"{{from_stop}}\",\n  \"to_stop_id\": \"{{to_stop}}\",\n  \"passenger_name\": \"Test Passenger\",\n  \"passenger_phone\": \"+9779800000001\",\n  \"fare_paid\": \"30.00\",\n  \"payment_method\": \"CASH\",\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"postman-test-001\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/tickets/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["tickets", ""] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.data && body.data.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('ticket_id', body.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Issue Ticket - Passenger Scan-to-Book",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{passenger_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"trip_qr_token\": \"<token from Get Trip QR response>\",\n  \"from_stop_id\": \"{{from_stop}}\",\n  \"to_stop_id\": \"{{to_stop}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/tickets/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["tickets", ""] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Issue Ticket - Passenger Self-Service",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{passenger_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"route_id\": \"{{route_id}}\",\n  \"from_stop_id\": \"{{from_stop}}\",\n  \"to_stop_id\": \"{{to_stop}}\",\n  \"fare_paid\": \"25.00\",\n  \"payment_method\": \"ESEWA\",\n  \"payment_reference\": \"ESEWA-TXN-TEST-001\",\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"postman-test-002\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/tickets/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["tickets", ""] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Validate Ticket (Conductor)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{conductor_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"boarding_stop_id\": \"{{from_stop}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/validate/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["tickets", "{{ticket_id}}", "validate", ""] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel Ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{passenger_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/cancel/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["tickets", "{{ticket_id}}", "cancel", ""] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Ticket by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{passenger_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["tickets", "{{ticket_id}}", ""] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get E-Ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{passenger_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/eticket/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["tickets", "{{ticket_id}}", "eticket", ""] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My Tickets (Passenger)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{passenger_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/tickets/my/", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["tickets", "my", ""] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Docs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Swagger UI",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/docs", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["docs"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{mobile_api_url}}/health", "host": ["{{mobile_api_url}}"], "path": ["health"] } }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
